,p_display_sequence=>90
,p_static_id=>'attribute_27'
,p_prompt=>'Patient JSON'
,p_apexlang_name=>'contextJson'
,p_attribute_type=>'TEXTAREA'
,p_is_required=>false
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_attribute_group_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(14502628304154823)
,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2('<p>Paste your JSON object here. This uses the same contract as every other patient source.</p><p><strong>Return one patient JSON object.</strong> Include identity and observations together; omit unused fields. Complete example (fictional):</p><pre>{"patient":{"name":"Demo patient (fictional)","mrn":"DEMO-CA3D-001","id":"DEMO-001","age":42,"sex":"Male","dateOfBirth":"1984-03-10","encounterId":"VISIT-DEMO-001","details":[{"id":"department","label":"Department","value":"General medicine"},{"id":"room","label":"Room","value":"A12"}]},"recording":{"source":"Nursing intake (demo)","recordedBy":"Demo nurse","recordedAt":"2026-11-17T09:15:00+03:00"},"observations":[{"id":"bp_systolic","label":"Systolic BP","value":126,"unit":"mmHg","examField":"bp_systolic"},{"id":"bp_diastolic","label":"Diastolic BP","value":78,"unit":"mmHg","examField":"bp_diastolic"},{"id":"pulse","label":"Pulse","value":82,"unit":"beats/min","examField":"pulse"},{"id":"temperature","label":"Temperature","value":36.8,"unit":"°C","examField":"temperature","readOnly":true},{"id":"weight","label":"Weight","value":72,"unit":"kg","examField":"weight","flag":"Review","highlight":true,"note":"Example review flag supplied by th',
'e source."},{"id":"height","label":"Height","value":175,"unit":"cm","examField":"height"},{"id":"spo2","label":"Oxygen saturation","value":98,"unit":"%","examField":"spo2"},{"id":"respiratory_rate","label":"Respiratory rate","value":16,"unit":"breaths/min","examField":"respiratory_rate"},{"id":"bmi","label":"BMI","value":23.5,"unit":"kg/m²"},{"id":"glucose","label":"Blood glucose","value":5.2,"unit":"mmol/L"},{"id":"pain","label":"Pain score","value":2,"unit":"/10"},{"id":"custom_observation","label":"Your custom label","value":"Your supplied value","unit":"","source":"Your source","recordedBy":"Your recorder","recordedAt":"2026-11-17T09:15:00+03:00","flag":"","highlight":false,"readOnly":false,"hidden":true,"note":"Optional note","examField":"your_configured_exam_field"}]}</pre><p>patient: name, mrn, id, age (number in years), sex, dateOfBirth, encounterId, details (custom id/label/value/unit). recording supplies source/recordedBy/recordedAt defaults. observations require unique id and scalar value (text, number, boolean or null). Optional label, unit, flag, highlight, readOnly, hidden, note, examField and recording overrides. Preset IDs and units are in the example; custom IDs/la',
'bels are supported. Age is supplied, not calculated.</p><p>Up to 40 observations, 12 patient details and 32767 payload characters. Null/empty values do not prefill. Matching examination fields/units are prefilled only when empty; existing answers/notes/deferrals are preserved. Flags/highlights come from your source; no thresholds or conversions are inferred. Display &amp; Prefill Options controls visibility, locking and saved snapshots.</p>'),null)
,p_depending_on_attribute_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(14618227588808095)
,p_depending_on_has_to_exist=>true
,p_depending_on_condition_type=>'EQUALS'
,p_depending_on_expression=>'JSON'
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_plugin_attribute(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(14618494834808095)
,p_plugin_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(14493163251601159)
,p_attribute_scope=>'COMPONENT'
,p_attribute_sequence=>28
,p_display_sequence=>90
,p_static_id=>'attribute_28'
,p_prompt=>'Patient JSON Query'
,p_apexlang_name=>'contextQuery'
,p_attribute_type=>'SQL'
,p_is_required=>true
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_attribute_group_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(14502628304154823)
,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2('<p><strong>Return zero/one row, exactly one JSON text column (VARCHAR2 or CLOB).</strong> Zero rows/NULL means no data. Bind page/application items normally; list changing page items in Patient Items to Submit. This runnable fictional example uses P402_PATIENT_NAME and P402_MRN; replace them with your own items or authorized query columns.</p><pre>select json_object(
  ''patient'' value json_object(
    ''name'' value :P402_PATIENT_NAME, ''mrn'' value :P402_MRN,
    ''id'' value ''DEMO-001'', ''age'' value 42, ''sex'' value ''Male'',
    ''dateOfBirth'' value ''1984-03-10'', ''encounterId'' value ''VISIT-DEMO-001'',
    ''details'' value json_array(json_object(''id'' value ''department'', ''label'' value ''Department'', ''value'' value ''General medicine''))),
  ''recording'' value json_object(''source'' value ''Nursing intake (demo)'',
    ''recordedBy'' value ''Demo nurse'', ''recordedAt'' value ''2026-11-17T09:15:00+03:00''),
  ''observations'' value json_query(q''~[{"id":"bp_systolic","label":"Systolic BP","value":126,"unit":"mmHg","examField":"bp_systolic"},{"id":"bp_diastolic","label":"Diastolic BP","value":78,"unit":"mmHg","examField":"bp_diastolic"},{"id":"pulse","label":"Pulse","value":82,"unit":"beats/min","examField":"pulse"',
'},{"id":"temperature","label":"Temperature","value":36.8,"unit":"°C","examField":"temperature","readOnly":true},{"id":"weight","label":"Weight","value":72,"unit":"kg","examField":"weight","flag":"Review","highlight":true,"note":"Example review flag supplied by the source."},{"id":"height","label":"Height","value":175,"unit":"cm","examField":"height"},{"id":"spo2","label":"Oxygen saturation","value":98,"unit":"%","examField":"spo2"},{"id":"respiratory_rate","label":"Respiratory rate","value":16,"unit":"breaths/min","examField":"respiratory_rate"}]~'', ''$'' returning clob)
  returning clob) as patient_payload
from dual</pre><p>Include any patient/observation keys from Patient JSON / Patient &amp; Observations Item Help. Up to 40 observations, 12 custom patient details, 32767 characters. For AJAX refresh run await skeleton3d.get(''P402_ANATOMY'').refreshContext();. Clear/load the correct assessment when changing patients.</p>'),null)
,p_sql_min_column_count=>1
,p_sql_max_column_count=>1
,p_depending_on_attribute_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(14618227588808095)
,p_depending_on_has_to_exist=>true
,p_depending_on_condition_type=>'EQUALS'
,p_depending_on_expression=>'SQL'
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_plugin_attribute(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(14618590839808095)
,p_plugin_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(14493163251601159)
,p_attribute_scope=>'COMPONENT'
,p_attribute_sequence=>29
,p_display_sequence=>90
,p_static_id=>'attribute_29'
,p_prompt=>'Patient JSON Function'
,p_apexlang_name=>'contextFunction'
,p_attribute_type=>'PLSQL FUNCTION BODY'
,p_is_required=>false
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_attribute_group_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(14502628304154823)
,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2('<p><strong>PL/SQL function body returning one JSON object as text/CLOB.</strong> The same complete patient payload is supported by every source. Page/application item binds work normally. Replace these fictional values and P402 item names with your authorized source.</p><pre>declare
  l_payload clob;
begin
  select json_object(
  ''patient'' value json_object(
    ''name'' value :P402_PATIENT_NAME, ''mrn'' value :P402_MRN,
    ''id'' value ''DEMO-001'', ''age'' value 42, ''sex'' value ''Male'',
    ''dateOfBirth'' value ''1984-03-10'', ''encounterId'' value ''VISIT-DEMO-001'',
    ''details'' value json_array(json_object(''id'' value ''department'', ''label'' value ''Department'', ''value'' value ''General medicine''))),
  ''recording'' value json_object(''source'' value ''Nursing intake (demo)'',
    ''recordedBy'' value ''Demo nurse'', ''recordedAt'' value ''2026-11-17T09:15:00+03:00''),
  ''observations'' value json_query(q''~[{"id":"bp_systolic","label":"Systolic BP","value":126,"unit":"mmHg","examField":"bp_systolic"},{"id":"bp_diastolic","label":"Diastolic BP","value":78,"unit":"mmHg","examField":"bp_diastolic"},{"id":"pulse","label":"Pulse","value":82,"unit":"beats/min","examField":"pulse"},{"id":"temperature","label":"Temperatu',
're","value":36.8,"unit":"°C","examField":"temperature","readOnly":true},{"id":"weight","label":"Weight","value":72,"unit":"kg","examField":"weight","flag":"Review","highlight":true,"note":"Example review flag supplied by the source."},{"id":"height","label":"Height","value":175,"unit":"cm","examField":"height"},{"id":"spo2","label":"Oxygen saturation","value":98,"unit":"%","examField":"spo2"},{"id":"respiratory_rate","label":"Respiratory rate","value":16,"unit":"breaths/min","examField":"respiratory_rate"}]~'', ''$'' returning clob)
  returning clob) into l_payload
from dual;
  return l_payload;
end;</pre><p>See Patient JSON / Patient &amp; Observations Item Help for every payload field. Limit: 32767 characters. For AJAX refresh, list input items in Patient Items to Submit and run await skeleton3d.get(''P402_ANATOMY'').refreshContext();. Clear/load the correct assessment before changing patients.</p>'),null)
,p_depending_on_attribute_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(14618227588808095)
,p_depending_on_has_to_exist=>true
,p_depending_on_condition_type=>'EQUALS'
,p_depending_on_expression=>'PLSQL'
);
